# Native projects are GENERATED ARTEFACTS, not source.
#
# Expo's Continuous Native Generation rebuilds ios/ and android/ from app.json and the
# config plugins. Committing them would put a Gradle wrapper JAR, launcher icon PNGs and
# iOS asset catalogues in the tree — and this repository is a Copier template with
# _templates_suffix set to "", which renders every file through Jinja and CANNOT render
# binaries. Keeping these generated is what keeps the tree text-only.
#
# If your project outgrows config plugins, run `expo prebuild`, decide deliberately
# whether to commit the output, and record it as an ADR. See TEMPLATE-GUIDE/11-EXTENDING.md.
/ios/
/android/

# Expo build and cache output
.expo/
.expo-bundle/
expo-env.d.ts

# Test output
coverage/

# Metro / bundler
.metro-health-check*
*.jsbundle
